## 3. what this does not close
  TavilyClient was 61.35% in the baseline — the finding's 'near-zero' is WebTools and TransportCheck,
  not this one — and TransportCheck is still 24.33%: it is the installer's own smoke test, which
  drives a real transport, so covering it honestly needs the harness the transport suites use
  rather than a cheap fixture. A170 therefore stays open, at PROGRESS, with WebTools done.
